All right, Nick.  I admit it.  I started it all with [http://people.fix.no/arj/lojban/unofficial-gismu.html].  The intention was to record gismu that had had some use, as apparently pitsa and taksi had.  I apologize for the rampant wordmakery and prescriptivism that followed it. -((tsali))

tsali, I did know it was you, and I have no intent to personally attack you on it; there's no need to apologise. But I do feel someone somewhere had to voice disapproval. -- nitcion.

